{"translation":{"id":"pan_irv","name":"ਇੰਡਿਅਨ ਰਿਵਾਇਜ਼ਡ ਵਰਜ਼ਨ (IRV) - ਪੰਜਾਬੀ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=pan","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=pan","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"IRV","englishName":"Punjabi Indian Revised Version Bible","language":"pan","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"7bcf70d369a169a12ac867ce44def25b36147b72029339f8c8d3c7a06bab588d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31104,"languageName":"ਪੰਜਾਬੀ","languageEnglishName":"Punjabi"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"pan_irv","name":"ਜ਼ਬੂਰ","commonName":"ਜ਼ਬੂਰ","title":"ਜ਼ਬੂਰ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"8a1b7c5c3025a80671b87659256d14a42fb58ace987b687a83db2b26ac8a5d95","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":82,"content":[{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["ਆਸਾਫ਼ ਦਾ ਭਜਨ"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ਪਰਮੇਸ਼ੁਰ ਦੀ ਮੰਡਲੀ ਵਿੱਚ ਪਰਮੇਸ਼ੁਰ ਬੈਠਾ ਹੈ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਉਹ ਦੇਵਤਿਆਂ","poem":1},{"noteId":37},{"text":"ਦਾ ਨਿਆਂ ਕਰਦਾ ਹੈ,","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਤੁਸੀਂ ਕਦ ਤੋੜੀ ਟੇਡਾ ਨਿਆਂ ਕਰੋਗੇ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਅਤੇ ਦੁਸ਼ਟਾਂ ਦਾ ਪੱਖਪਾਤ ਕਰੋਗੇ? ਸਲਹ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਨਿਤਾਣੇ ਅਤੇ ਯਤੀਮ ਦਾ ਨਿਆਂ ਕਰੋ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਮਸਕੀਨ ਅਤੇ ਗਰੀਬ ਦਾ ਇਨਸਾਫ਼ ਕਰੋ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਨਿਤਾਣੇ ਅਤੇ ਕੰਗਾਲ ਨੂੰ ਬਚਾਓ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਉਨ੍ਹਾਂ ਨੂੰ ਦੁਸ਼ਟ ਦੇ ਹੱਥੋਂ ਛੁਡਾਓ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਓਹ ਨਹੀਂ ਜਾਣਦੇ ਅਤੇ ਨਾ ਸਮਝਦੇ ਹਨ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਓਹ ਅਨ੍ਹੇਰੇ ਵਿੱਚ ਫਿਰਦੇ ਹਨ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਧਰਤੀ ਦੀਆਂ ਸਾਰੀਆਂ ਨੀਂਹਾਂ ਡੋਲ ਜਾਂਦੀਆਂ ਹਨ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਮੈਂ ਆਖਿਆ, ਤੁਸੀਂ ਦੇਵਤੇ ਹੋ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਅਤੇ ਤੁਸੀਂ ਸੱਭੇ ਅੱਤ ਮਹਾਨ ਦੇ ਪੁੱਤਰ ਹੋ।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਪਰੰਤੂ ਤੁਸੀਂ ਇਨਸਾਨ ਵਾਂਗੂੰ ਮਰੋਗੇ ਅਤੇ ਸਰਦਾਰਾਂ ਵਿੱਚੋਂ ਇੱਕ ਵਾਂਗੂੰ ਡਿੱਗ ਪਓਗੇ!","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਹੇ ਪਰਮੇਸ਼ੁਰ, ਉੱਠ, ਸੰਸਾਰ ਦਾ ਨਿਆਂ ਕਰ!","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਕਿਉਂ ਜੋ ਤੂੰ ਸਾਰੀਆਂ ਕੌਮਾਂ ਨੂੰ ਆਪਣੀ ਮਿਰਾਸ ਬਣਾਵੇਂਗਾ।","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":37,"caller":"+","text":"ਗਿਰਾਏ ਹੋਏ ਦੂਤ","reference":{"chapter":82,"verse":1}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/82.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/83.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/81.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}